<title>USA: Rexhall delays Q4 earnings release.</title>
<headline>Rexhall delays Q4 earnings release.</headline>
<dateline>LANCASTER, Calif. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rexhall Industries Inc on Monday said it will delay the release of its fourth quarter earnings for two weeks while it and its auditors, Deloitte and Touche, &quot;reconcile differences in the area of inventory.&quot;</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
